<section class="home-faq section-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="home-faq__inner">
    {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="home-faq__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="home-faq__accordion">
      {% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          <details class="home-faq__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <summary class="home-faq__summary">
              <span>{{ block.settings.question | escape }}</span>
              <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </summary>
            {% if block.settings.answer != blank %}
              <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
                {{ block.settings.answer }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </details>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>What are custom patches?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Custom patches are personalized embroidered or printed patches made from your logo, artwork, or text. They are commonly used for uniforms, clubs, events, brands, and personal apparel.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>How does pricing work?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Pricing is based on patch size, quantity, backing type, and design complexity. Larger quantities usually reduce the price per patch.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>What backing options are available?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Popular options include iron-on, hook and loop (Velcro), sew-on, adhesive, and magnetic backing. You can choose the one that best fits how you will apply your patches.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>How do I order patches?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Select your patch style, upload your design, choose size and backing, then place your order online. Our team reviews your artwork and confirms details before production.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>Can I create my own design?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Yes. You can upload your own artwork, logo, or concept. If needed, our design team can help refine it to make sure it works well as a patch.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>Are patches washable?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Yes. Our patches are made for durability and can handle normal washing when applied correctly. For best longevity, wash garments inside out on gentle cycles.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>Is there a minimum order quantity?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Minimum quantities can vary by patch type, but small and bulk runs are both available. Contact us if you need help choosing the most cost-effective quantity.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>How fast can I get my order?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Standard production and shipping times depend on order size and approval speed. Rush options may be available if you need your patches by a specific date.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq__item">
          <summary class="home-faq__summary">
            <span>Do you offer a sample pack?</span>
            <span class="home-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="home-faq__panel rte">
            <p>Yes, sample options are available so you can review quality and materials before larger orders. Reach out and we can guide you to the right sample option.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

